### Audiophile payment slice — click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code REST Client or Visual Studio).
@base = http://localhost:5040

### 1. Catalogue — copy a product id into @productId below
GET {{base}}/products

###
@productId = PASTE-A-PRODUCT-ID

### 2. Card order → response.payment.checkoutUrl opens Fawaterak's hosted page
#    Test card (always succeeds): 5123450000000008 · "Fawaterak test" · 12/26 · CVV 100
#    Test card (always fails):    4222 0000 0672 4235 · 12/26 · CVV 123
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-card-001

{
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "Card",
  "shipping": {
    "fullName": "Mona Hassan",
    "phone": "+201000000000",
    "street": "12 Tahrir Street",
    "city": "Cairo",
    "country": "Egypt",
    "postalCode": null
  }
}

### 3. Same request, same Idempotency-Key → 200 with the same order, no second invoice
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-card-001

{
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "Card",
  "shipping": { "fullName": "Mona Hassan", "phone": "+201000000000", "street": "12 Tahrir Street", "city": "Cairo", "country": "Egypt", "postalCode": null }
}

### 4. Fawry / cash outlet ("Kiosk") → the hosted page shows the code to pay in cash
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-fawry-001

{
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "Kiosk",
  "shipping": { "fullName": "Mona Hassan", "phone": "+201000000000", "street": "12 Tahrir Street", "city": "Cairo", "country": "Egypt", "postalCode": null }
}

### 5. Cash on delivery — confirmed immediately, no gateway
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-cod-001

{
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1 } ],
  "paymentMethod": "CashOnDelivery",
  "shipping": { "fullName": "Mona Hassan", "phone": "+201000000000", "street": "12 Tahrir Street", "city": "Cairo", "country": "Egypt", "postalCode": null }
}

### 6. My orders
GET {{base}}/orders

###
@orderId = PASTE-AN-ORDER-ID

### 7. One order — watch Pending → Confirmed when the webhook lands
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### 8. Webhook missed? Ask Fawaterak directly (getInvoiceData)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payment/sync

### 9. What the gateway told us about this order (audit trail)
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payment/events

### 10. Refund — Fawaterak has no public refund API, so this explains to use the dashboard
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 11. A forged webhook is rejected with 401
POST {{base}}/payments/fawaterak/webhook_json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hashKey": "forged", "invoice_id": 1, "invoice_key": "x", "payment_method": "Card", "invoice_status": "paid" }
